WEBVTT

00:05.797 --> 00:07.882
[theme music playing]

00:15.306 --> 00:16.808
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS

00:22.647 --> 00:24.649
[suspenseful music playing]

00:58.850 --> 00:59.684
[clang]

01:15.116 --> 01:16.326
[growling]

01:45.230 --> 01:47.232
[water trickling]

01:51.236 --> 01:52.362
[sighs]

02:27.272 --> 02:28.314
[sighs]

02:30.483 --> 02:32.068
You must eat, Your Royal Highness.

02:35.363 --> 02:39.784
It is not Your Royal Highness's fault.
You did your best to save those people.

02:40.451 --> 02:42.287
If I had stepped in sooner,

02:43.997 --> 02:45.498
I could have saved them.

02:45.582 --> 02:48.042
Then you would have ended up dead.

02:53.173 --> 02:54.632
You said you must stay alive.

02:55.049 --> 02:57.510
Did you not conspire treason
in order to stay alive?

02:59.429 --> 03:00.430
[sighs]

03:02.682 --> 03:04.309
I wanted to be different.

03:07.770 --> 03:10.148
I wanted to be different from those...

03:12.192 --> 03:13.443
who abandoned the weak.

03:16.779 --> 03:18.198
[Seo-bi] And you were.

03:21.409 --> 03:23.953
That is how I saw it.

03:30.835 --> 03:34.214
I will look for some herbs
to treat the wound.

04:23.388 --> 04:24.722
[Chang] Is he back?

04:28.184 --> 04:29.477
[Mu-yeong] Not yet, I am afraid.

04:30.353 --> 04:31.854
His name is still unknown.

04:32.981 --> 04:36.276
His name Yeong-sin
as well as his identity tag are fake.

04:37.610 --> 04:41.489
At the moment, we need someone
who knows the area well.

04:42.240 --> 04:45.493
Did Your Royal Highness
not see him wield the rifle?

04:46.703 --> 04:48.997
Not even palace guards are that skilled.

04:49.664 --> 04:52.792
Those who can match that level of prowess

04:52.875 --> 04:54.419
are the members of Chakho.

04:55.253 --> 04:58.298
Are you talking about the elite troop
that hunts tigers?

04:58.381 --> 04:59.299
Yes.

05:00.091 --> 05:02.302
Since tiger hunting is dangerous,

05:02.760 --> 05:05.763
the members are chosen
based on their fighting skills

05:05.847 --> 05:07.724
regardless of their social status.

05:08.683 --> 05:12.437
Many of them are quite dangerous.
They would do anything

05:13.271 --> 05:14.814
to stay alive.

05:18.026 --> 05:21.321
They would do anything to stay alive?

05:21.404 --> 05:23.114
They are like me, then.

05:23.823 --> 05:24.824
Your Royal Highness.

05:24.907 --> 05:25.950
- [cracking]
- [gasps]

05:33.791 --> 05:34.792
Speak to me.

05:34.876 --> 05:36.627
No soldiers are on our tail.

05:37.712 --> 05:41.382
I also checked a few villages on the way.
The disease has not spread yet,

05:41.466 --> 05:43.593
but the people are terrified
by its rumors.

05:44.010 --> 05:45.636
Judging by the vacant residences,

05:45.720 --> 05:47.680
many villagers must have already fled.

06:10.078 --> 06:11.371
[indistinct whispering]

06:13.706 --> 06:15.416
[ominous music playing]

06:32.725 --> 06:34.560
[low rumble]

06:51.369 --> 06:52.787
[Seo-bi screams]

06:52.870 --> 06:54.205
[swords rasp]

07:04.841 --> 07:07.301
A monster! It is a monster!

07:08.052 --> 07:09.595
[panting]

07:23.109 --> 07:25.111
[whimpering]

07:26.487 --> 07:29.824
Water. Give me some water. Water!

07:32.243 --> 07:33.327
Is that...

07:33.744 --> 07:34.620
Magistrate Cho?

07:35.913 --> 07:37.206
Your Royal Highness?

07:38.666 --> 07:40.626
Your Royal Highness. Are you really--

07:40.710 --> 07:42.879
[grunts] Your Royal Highness, I--

07:42.962 --> 07:44.422
[groaning]

07:47.175 --> 07:49.677
Do you know how much blood
the people you abandoned shed?

07:50.344 --> 07:51.345
[Mu-yeong] Please stop.

07:51.762 --> 07:53.264
He is not even worth killing.

07:54.849 --> 07:56.559
[groaning]

08:00.855 --> 08:04.150
Did you not run for your life?
What happened to you?

08:04.692 --> 08:06.861
Well, the cargo ship...

08:07.612 --> 08:09.947
The disease spread on the ship.

08:11.949 --> 08:13.159
What do you mean?

08:16.496 --> 08:19.040
An infected corpse was on the ship.

08:19.123 --> 08:22.793
The corpse infected everyone on board.

08:22.877 --> 08:25.463
Only I was able to make it out alive.

08:25.546 --> 08:26.714
Where is the ship now?

08:28.132 --> 08:31.802
The disease started to spread
when we reached Seongju, so...

08:33.554 --> 08:34.847
If that is the case,

08:36.933 --> 08:38.351
they will reach Sangju soon.

08:39.060 --> 08:42.396
Messengers were already sent,
so Sangju must be prepared for it.

08:42.480 --> 08:47.777
Actually, only city-fortresses
near Dongnae were notified of the disease.

08:50.696 --> 08:53.741
If Mungyeong Saejae in Sangju falls,

08:54.200 --> 08:56.160
the disease will reach Hanyang in no time.

09:06.379 --> 09:08.214
We will leave for Sangju right away.

09:11.801 --> 09:14.720
[whimpering] Your Royal Highness!
Your Royal Highness!

09:15.263 --> 09:18.432
Please... Let me come with you.
Your Royal Highness!

09:18.516 --> 09:20.518
[ominous music playing]

09:26.315 --> 09:28.442
[mast creaking]

09:29.235 --> 09:30.319
[pigs oinking]

09:32.697 --> 09:34.073
[chickens clucking]

09:36.701 --> 09:38.452
[pig snorting]

09:38.536 --> 09:39.662
[snarling]

09:40.329 --> 09:41.831
[rumbling]

09:54.969 --> 09:57.013
[Yeong-sin]
Sangju is right over that mountain!

09:57.096 --> 09:58.514
[Chang] Once Sangju is breached,

09:58.598 --> 10:00.808
the disease will spread
all over the nation.

10:01.225 --> 10:02.351
We must stop it.

10:04.937 --> 10:09.609
SANGJU

10:09.692 --> 10:11.694
[rhythmic music playing]

10:28.961 --> 10:30.504
[murmuring]

10:46.437 --> 10:47.688
Are the rumors true?

10:47.772 --> 10:50.066
- What?
- A cursed disease is spreading.

10:50.650 --> 10:53.319
They say a headless ghost
appears in the night.

10:54.528 --> 10:55.571
[gasps]

11:09.627 --> 11:11.671
[Deok-seong]
A signal fire has been sent from Dongnae.

11:11.754 --> 11:13.464
The messenger is yet to arrive,

11:13.547 --> 11:15.883
so the local government
does not know about the details.

11:15.966 --> 11:16.967
However,

11:18.511 --> 11:20.846
a strange rumor is spreading
across Gyeongsang.

11:21.514 --> 11:23.432
A disease is spreading in Dongnae,

11:23.516 --> 11:26.936
and its victims do not seem to stay dead.

11:46.622 --> 11:47.707
Get ready.

11:50.084 --> 11:51.544
I am leaving the mountains.

11:53.170 --> 11:58.092
This talisman will chase away
all diseases and ghosts.

11:58.175 --> 11:59.009
[people exclaim]

11:59.093 --> 12:04.724
The talisman written in cinnabar
by this young shaman is only ten bun.

12:04.807 --> 12:06.016
Only ten bun, people!

12:06.100 --> 12:09.145
- [man] Give me one, please.
- Here, it is ten bun.

12:09.228 --> 12:11.063
Give me one too.
This is all I have though.

12:11.147 --> 12:13.607
How dare you try to bargain with me!

12:13.691 --> 12:15.484
You are bad luck. Shoo! Ten bun!

12:15.568 --> 12:16.944
- Bring the money.
- Damn it!

12:17.737 --> 12:19.613
[gasps] Lord Ahn Hyeon.

12:19.697 --> 12:21.407
- Lord Ahn Hyeon!
- Lord Ahn Hyeon is here!

12:35.171 --> 12:36.672
- [horse neighs]
- Whoa.

12:41.427 --> 12:45.222
My lord, upon my inspection,
I found something peculiar by the stream.

12:45.306 --> 12:46.891
You must see it for yourself.

12:50.478 --> 12:52.688
[Ahn Hyeon]
Why is a ship that belongs to the nation

12:53.272 --> 12:54.857
stranded here at this stream?

12:55.274 --> 12:57.109
I suspect a huge commotion, my lord.

12:57.526 --> 13:00.529
It must be why a signal fire
was sent from Dongnae.

13:01.405 --> 13:02.531
[Ahn Hyeon] Giddyap!

13:09.288 --> 13:11.123
[Chang panting]

13:13.584 --> 13:14.627
[groans]

13:15.503 --> 13:18.339
There is a village deep in this forest.

13:19.048 --> 13:21.675
- Yes, of slash-and-burn farmers.
- [Beom-pal] Huh? [sniffs]

13:21.759 --> 13:24.762
I smell... grilled meat.

13:24.845 --> 13:26.847
[sniffs] I smell pork.

13:39.485 --> 13:43.781
Here and on the deck,
there is blood everywhere.

14:17.648 --> 14:19.775
The floors and walls are covered in blood,

14:20.943 --> 14:24.613
so where are the injured or the dead?

14:32.538 --> 14:34.707
[indistinct chattering]

14:36.500 --> 14:40.170
[man] You never know when we will
eat again, so eat up while you can.

14:40.254 --> 14:42.256
[villagers clamoring]

14:42.965 --> 14:45.342
- [man 2] Eat up!
- [man 3] Do not forget to chew.

14:46.594 --> 14:48.762
- [man 3] Do not eat too much rice.
- [man 4] This is good.

14:48.846 --> 14:49.805
[man 3] Eat the pork...

14:58.647 --> 14:59.648
This is odd.

15:00.691 --> 15:03.402
People are dying of famine,
but here they eat rice and pork.

15:06.780 --> 15:10.367
What brings you by deep into this forest?

15:10.826 --> 15:12.077
Where is this food from?

15:12.786 --> 15:13.829
Well,

15:15.497 --> 15:18.626
we received it as payment
for helping out at a party.

15:18.709 --> 15:19.793
[scoffs]

15:21.211 --> 15:22.504
- Oh!
- [giggles]

15:23.839 --> 15:25.132
No way.

15:25.215 --> 15:27.134
Move. Get out of my way!

15:28.135 --> 15:28.969
[grunts]

15:30.012 --> 15:32.514
Step aside. I told you to move!

15:32.598 --> 15:33.599
[woman yelps]

15:38.437 --> 15:40.439
I see cargo from the ship!

15:40.856 --> 15:42.858
They must have looted the ship.

15:43.192 --> 15:44.193
I apologize!

15:44.276 --> 15:46.862
[stuttering] Please spare my life.

15:46.946 --> 15:48.238
We are terribly sorry.

15:48.822 --> 15:49.990
[murmuring]

15:50.950 --> 15:53.243
It was not our intent
to steal from the ship.

15:53.327 --> 15:56.580
The food was just too good to pass up on.

15:56.664 --> 15:58.999
[villagers] Please spare our lives!

15:59.625 --> 16:00.793
Please forgive us.

16:01.251 --> 16:04.254
Was there anyone on the ship?

16:04.338 --> 16:07.675
Everyone was dead when we arrived.

16:07.758 --> 16:09.635
I went to check on the ship this morning.

16:09.718 --> 16:13.597
The passengers were gnawed at
as if animals had attacked them.

16:13.681 --> 16:14.932
Please believe me.

16:15.015 --> 16:17.643
What about the bodies?
Did you just leave them there?

16:17.726 --> 16:20.104
Animals would have gotten to them,

16:21.021 --> 16:22.523
so we buried them all.

16:22.606 --> 16:23.857
Where did you bury them?

16:25.859 --> 16:26.819
[shouts] Where?

16:28.904 --> 16:31.740
You all committed a heinous crime.

16:31.824 --> 16:35.619
However, I understand you did so
out of hunger.

16:35.703 --> 16:39.498
If you are honest with me,
I will lessen your punishments.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.338
Let us lead the way.

16:52.511 --> 16:54.179
[Deok-seong] I found wheel marks!

17:15.576 --> 17:16.660
Are we not there yet?

17:19.246 --> 17:20.581
[man] We are almost there.

17:35.721 --> 17:36.805
Is this the place?

17:39.475 --> 17:41.852
What are you doing? Keep leading the way!

17:52.905 --> 17:56.617
We know that those who steal
government property get beheaded.

17:57.409 --> 17:59.912
What are you talking about?

17:59.995 --> 18:02.331
We have lived long enough lives,

18:03.707 --> 18:05.793
but our children do not deserve to die.

18:05.876 --> 18:09.421
Without you to talk of our crimes,
our sins will stay hidden.

18:11.465 --> 18:13.258
You damn bastards.

18:13.842 --> 18:15.677
Do you know who you are addressing?

18:16.261 --> 18:17.262
Lower your weapons!

18:22.726 --> 18:25.062
This matter is graver than stealing.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.563
If this does not get sorted,

18:27.147 --> 18:28.649
not only you and your children

18:28.732 --> 18:32.069
but everyone in Gyeongsang might die.

18:34.404 --> 18:36.115
Now lead us to the corpses!

18:41.328 --> 18:43.163
Has hunger impaired your hearing?

18:43.580 --> 18:45.374
Where are the bodies?

18:48.836 --> 18:50.087
You are stepping on them.

19:04.017 --> 19:05.644
[creatures snarling]

19:21.702 --> 19:23.245
[men screaming]

19:23.328 --> 19:24.705
What is that?

19:24.788 --> 19:26.540
- [growling]
- [men screaming]

19:32.504 --> 19:33.630
[grunting]

19:35.507 --> 19:37.843
[men screaming]

19:40.596 --> 19:41.597
[snarls]

19:45.392 --> 19:46.310
[groans]

19:48.020 --> 19:49.605
[clamoring]

19:51.857 --> 19:52.858
My lord!

19:55.861 --> 19:57.196
[men whimpering]

19:58.405 --> 20:00.115
[creatures snarling]

20:03.160 --> 20:04.036
[blowing]

20:07.748 --> 20:08.916
If you wish to live,

20:10.959 --> 20:13.086
raise your weapons and behead them all.

20:13.670 --> 20:15.923
[men whimpering]

20:16.006 --> 20:18.175
[snarling]

20:32.231 --> 20:33.482
[snarling]

20:35.275 --> 20:37.236
[men screaming]

20:41.156 --> 20:42.115
[gunshot]

20:43.242 --> 20:44.409
[men whimpering]

20:44.493 --> 20:45.577
[growling]

20:48.789 --> 20:49.957
[screaming]

20:50.040 --> 20:51.250
[growling]

20:54.044 --> 20:55.712
[grunting]

21:00.342 --> 21:01.885
[snarling]

21:04.304 --> 21:05.973
[Beom-pal]
Here is another wave of monsters!

21:10.477 --> 21:11.812
[growling]

21:12.354 --> 21:13.814
[gunshot]

21:16.358 --> 21:18.026
- [growls]
- [grunts]

21:25.826 --> 21:26.827
[grunts]

21:32.249 --> 21:34.334
[screaming]

21:35.127 --> 21:35.961
[snarling]

21:36.044 --> 21:38.005
No. Oh, no!

21:40.382 --> 21:41.591
Help me!

21:43.135 --> 21:44.594
No! No!

21:49.933 --> 21:51.184
[grunting]

21:53.020 --> 21:54.146
[snarling]

21:59.693 --> 22:01.486
[screaming]

22:04.698 --> 22:06.450
- [snarling]
- [grunting]

22:11.913 --> 22:13.165
[yelling]

22:15.500 --> 22:16.752
[growling]

22:17.919 --> 22:19.087
[grunting]

22:28.013 --> 22:29.473
[panting]

23:00.170 --> 23:01.755
[wind gusting]

23:03.256 --> 23:05.425
[muffled sounds]

23:19.815 --> 23:21.817
[tense music playing]

23:26.113 --> 23:27.155
[grunts]

23:47.551 --> 23:48.552
[grunting]

24:28.800 --> 24:30.802
[grunting]

25:08.465 --> 25:10.717
[sighs] Please come down!

25:11.134 --> 25:13.053
Must I force you down here?

25:13.512 --> 25:16.097
[child sobbing] I will be killed if I do.

25:16.181 --> 25:19.976
Everyone wants me out of the palace.

25:20.393 --> 25:23.772
If I am deposed, I will be killed.

25:24.105 --> 25:25.649
[sobbing]

25:25.732 --> 25:29.444
I miss my late mother.

25:31.279 --> 25:32.906
You are not supposed to be here.

25:33.615 --> 25:34.699
[sobbing]

25:35.575 --> 25:36.535
[sighs]

25:39.913 --> 25:41.414
This is not...

25:42.999 --> 25:44.209
where you should be.

25:49.339 --> 25:51.258
GANGNYEONGJEON

25:52.634 --> 25:54.469
[child] I do not want to go there.

25:54.928 --> 25:57.097
Master, I would rather go back.

26:01.351 --> 26:03.144
[Ahn Hyeon] What you said is right.

26:03.728 --> 26:05.355
His Majesty has received

26:06.106 --> 26:09.359
a stack of appeals
that claim your deposition.

26:10.777 --> 26:11.987
To make it worse,

26:12.070 --> 26:14.698
there is no one in the palace
who can protect you.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.157
So...

26:17.284 --> 26:18.785
you must protect yourself.

26:24.708 --> 26:26.042
Your Royal Highness...

26:27.419 --> 26:30.171
is not just trying
to protect your own life.

26:31.047 --> 26:33.049
You are in a battle against injustice.

26:33.133 --> 26:35.218
There are those who are trying to make

26:35.302 --> 26:38.555
the Crown Prince their puppets
for their own interest.

26:38.638 --> 26:40.682
Fighting and winning against that evil

26:41.224 --> 26:43.268
is the only way to uphold justice.

27:06.166 --> 27:07.459
Show your respects!

27:08.168 --> 27:09.711
He is the Crown Prince,

27:10.587 --> 27:11.921
the heir to the throne!

27:14.799 --> 27:17.469
[servants] We greet His Royal Highness!

27:26.394 --> 27:27.604
It has been a while,

27:29.147 --> 27:30.023
Master.

27:41.451 --> 27:43.411
There is no lie to any of it.

27:43.953 --> 27:45.038
Father...

27:48.124 --> 27:49.459
has passed away.

27:50.210 --> 27:52.921
Lord Cho, who is obsessed with power,
had Physician Lee Seung-hui

27:53.004 --> 27:56.091
feed my father the resurrection plant
which turned him into...

27:57.550 --> 27:58.760
a flesh-craving monster.

27:59.219 --> 28:01.388
That is what started
the horrific epidemic.

28:04.224 --> 28:06.685
Cho Hak-ju is as atrocious as ever.
You must help.

28:07.894 --> 28:10.522
I will return to Hanyang,
punish the Haewon Cho Clan,

28:11.648 --> 28:13.608
and build this nation anew.

28:16.986 --> 28:18.321
[exhales]

28:20.657 --> 28:22.033
When was the last time...

28:23.410 --> 28:25.370
you had some sleep?

28:26.913 --> 28:28.289
What do you mean?

28:29.833 --> 28:32.335
Have you come all this way

28:33.378 --> 28:35.588
despite the hunger
and disheveled appearance?

28:38.842 --> 28:40.719
Thugs on the street can do so.

28:41.428 --> 28:42.303
However...

28:44.222 --> 28:45.640
Your Royal Highness may not.

28:47.225 --> 28:48.560
The Crown Prince

28:49.185 --> 28:50.353
must always...

28:51.312 --> 28:54.733
look decent and confident.

29:03.074 --> 29:07.495
Sangju is my hometown
and where I currently reside.

29:08.830 --> 29:10.290
I urge you, Your Royal Highness,

29:10.999 --> 29:12.584
to rest peacefully for tonight.

29:15.295 --> 29:16.838
- [Deok-seong] Hurry.
- [servant] Yes, sir.

29:18.214 --> 29:20.091
[rattling]

29:35.148 --> 29:38.985
What kind of a man is Lord Ahn Hyeon?

29:41.905 --> 29:43.281
Why are you asking me that?

29:43.823 --> 29:45.575
Do you not find it odd?

29:47.285 --> 29:49.579
Neither Lord Ahn nor his servants

29:49.662 --> 29:52.081
were alarmed at the sight of the ill.

29:52.165 --> 29:55.835
They swiftly beheaded
and burned the infected.

29:55.919 --> 29:58.338
They did not hesitate
in fighting the infected.

29:58.421 --> 30:02.717
It is as if they knew well
about the infected.

30:10.099 --> 30:11.643
Escort His Royal Highness.

30:11.726 --> 30:14.395
Also, find his companions a place to rest.

30:15.271 --> 30:16.898
[servant 2] This way, Your Royal Highness.

30:41.464 --> 30:43.091
What did Lord Ahn say?

30:44.092 --> 30:46.761
He did not give me a definite answer.

30:50.056 --> 30:51.975
Can he truly be trusted?

30:54.602 --> 30:55.645
Your Royal Highness.

30:56.604 --> 30:58.398
He may still be mourning,

30:58.481 --> 31:00.650
but even when Lord Cho
suppressed the scholars,

31:00.733 --> 31:03.361
Lord Ahn did not even lift a finger
to help them.

31:04.737 --> 31:07.574
He could be in alliance with Lord Cho.

31:07.657 --> 31:08.950
Watch what you say.

31:10.285 --> 31:12.412
He is not one for you to speak lightly of.

31:13.955 --> 31:16.416
- But Your Royal Highness--
- Get some rest too.

31:17.250 --> 31:19.502
You have not been able to
these past few days.

31:22.297 --> 31:23.381
[sighs]

31:27.343 --> 31:29.053
PATIENT JOURNAL

31:34.642 --> 31:38.021
HANYANG

31:44.068 --> 31:44.903
Look here.

31:44.986 --> 31:49.490
Why does he get food and not me?
Why? Seriously?

31:50.033 --> 31:51.034
[sighs]

31:55.455 --> 31:56.581
[chokes]

31:57.165 --> 31:58.374
[retches]

31:58.791 --> 31:59.751
[snorting]

32:05.006 --> 32:06.507
[man] What is wrong?

32:06.591 --> 32:08.176
[groaning]

32:08.259 --> 32:09.260
My gosh.

32:12.263 --> 32:13.640
Over here!

32:14.182 --> 32:15.892
Look...

32:18.645 --> 32:20.647
[prisoner growling]

32:25.318 --> 32:26.277
[prisoner 2 gasps]

32:27.779 --> 32:29.072
[snarling]

32:29.822 --> 32:30.949
[growling]

32:31.574 --> 32:32.992
[prisoner 2 screaming]

32:37.664 --> 32:39.374
[screaming continues]

32:42.377 --> 32:44.253
- [munching]
- [screaming]

32:53.972 --> 32:56.391
[snarling]

32:56.474 --> 32:58.476
[snarling]

33:11.322 --> 33:12.865
[snarling]

33:25.628 --> 33:27.505
[growling]

33:29.632 --> 33:32.552
Feeding the flesh of the infected
to a healthy subject

33:33.511 --> 33:37.515
leads to the transmission of the disease.

33:39.017 --> 33:40.852
This cannot be controlled.

33:43.187 --> 33:45.106
Before it reaches the northern region,

33:46.274 --> 33:47.859
the epidemic must be contained.

33:50.737 --> 33:52.071
[snoring]

34:06.210 --> 34:07.879
[birds chirping]

34:13.634 --> 34:14.635
[grunts]

34:23.019 --> 34:26.105
MONUMENT TO THE BATTLE OF UNPO WETLAND

34:29.650 --> 34:32.278
TO COMMEMORATE THE GREAT VICTORY
OF GOVERNOR AHN HYEON OF GYEONGSANG,

34:32.361 --> 34:34.489
WHO DEFEATED 30,000 JAPANESE SOLDIERS
WITH 500 SOLDIERS

34:47.585 --> 34:51.714
SUMANG VILLAGE

34:58.638 --> 34:59.972
[boy sobbing] Do not go.

35:16.572 --> 35:19.075
Please do not leave me.
Please do not leave me.

35:19.158 --> 35:20.493
Can you please stay?

35:20.576 --> 35:22.912
Go back inside. I promise I will be back.

35:30.002 --> 35:31.754
Please! Do not go!

35:31.838 --> 35:33.714
[boy sobbing]

35:36.926 --> 35:39.387
You must come back.

35:39.971 --> 35:41.305
You must!

36:35.484 --> 36:37.695
NORTH GATE OF SANGJU

36:37.778 --> 36:39.447
Here comes a messenger!

36:46.954 --> 36:47.914
Oh.

36:49.290 --> 36:51.083
How did it go? Did you find it?

36:51.626 --> 36:53.586
- Is this it, my lord?
- Yes, it is.

36:56.380 --> 36:57.506
Good job.

37:05.181 --> 37:08.809
Is that the cargo from the ship?

37:08.893 --> 37:09.852
Yes, my lord.

37:10.436 --> 37:12.271
Nothing disastrous happened

37:12.355 --> 37:15.191
thanks to Lord Ahn
locating the infected heading north,

37:15.733 --> 37:18.486
but he mentioned
to heighten security down south.

37:18.569 --> 37:19.445
Anyway,

37:19.904 --> 37:22.823
- is it true?
- May I ask what you are referring to?

37:25.409 --> 37:29.121
I heard that His Royal Highness
is here in Sangju.

37:29.205 --> 37:30.665
Is it true?

37:32.959 --> 37:34.126
[officer] My lord!

37:36.754 --> 37:40.383
The Five Armies have left Hanyang
and are headed for Mungyeong Saejae.

37:42.301 --> 37:44.303
[tense music playing]

38:11.205 --> 38:12.999
Oh! Hey, Seo-bi!

38:13.457 --> 38:15.084
Seo-bi! [pants]

38:22.633 --> 38:24.218
[panting]

38:24.302 --> 38:27.054
Where have you been all by yourself?
I looked for you everywhere.

38:27.138 --> 38:29.473
I was searching for medicinal herbs
for His Royal Highness.

38:29.557 --> 38:30.933
Forget about the herbs.

38:31.976 --> 38:34.812
Run away with me.
You will die if you return to his side.

38:34.895 --> 38:37.398
- Follow me.
- What are you talking about?

38:38.357 --> 38:41.235
The Five Armies are coming
to arrest His Royal Highness.

38:41.319 --> 38:42.278
What?

38:43.237 --> 38:44.405
Is that true?

38:44.488 --> 38:47.825
Being with a man who committed treason
will ensure your death.

38:49.201 --> 38:51.746
I am of the Haewon Cho Clan,

38:51.829 --> 38:54.165
so I will be able to protect you. Come on!

38:56.625 --> 38:58.002
Are you running away again?

38:58.085 --> 38:59.295
No, well--

38:59.378 --> 39:01.964
His Royal Highness jumped through hoops

39:02.048 --> 39:04.508
to save the people you abandoned,

39:04.592 --> 39:07.011
but here you are
turning your back on him again.

39:07.511 --> 39:11.349
Is it really hard for you to show bravery
for once in your life?

39:11.849 --> 39:13.434
Well, you see--

39:13.517 --> 39:15.061
Run away on your own.

39:15.895 --> 39:18.522
- I will stay with His Royal Highness.
- But, wait...

39:20.566 --> 39:21.442
Seo-bi!

39:22.610 --> 39:23.986
Seo-bi!

39:24.653 --> 39:25.696
Seo-bi!

39:36.665 --> 39:39.210
[woman 1] Slow down or you will choke.

39:39.293 --> 39:42.588
You do not have to be greedy.
There is more, so eat up.

39:43.089 --> 39:45.883
My goodness, you look too young
to be pregnant.

39:45.966 --> 39:47.343
[laughing]

39:47.968 --> 39:49.136
Here, let me take it.

39:49.220 --> 39:53.349
Thank you for taking care
of lowly peasants like us.

39:53.432 --> 39:54.975
There is no need to thank me.

39:55.059 --> 39:57.728
Stop talking nonsense and just eat up.

39:57.812 --> 39:58.938
- [women] Sure!
- Thank you.

39:59.021 --> 40:01.023
[woman 1] Eat up and give birth to sons!

40:01.107 --> 40:03.150
[women] Thank you.

40:07.113 --> 40:08.781
By the way, who could it be?

40:08.864 --> 40:11.075
Who is taking such good care of us?

40:11.158 --> 40:12.785
How should we know? Just eat up.

40:12.868 --> 40:13.953
[laughing]

40:14.036 --> 40:15.830
- No one is telling us.
- Well,

40:15.913 --> 40:18.958
I am grateful for the food
and the shelter,

40:19.041 --> 40:20.751
but I still find it odd.

40:21.502 --> 40:24.588
Why have they only gathered
pregnant women who have nowhere to go?

40:24.672 --> 40:27.383
Eat up while it is all for free.

40:27.466 --> 40:29.718
It looks like you will give birth
any time now.

40:29.802 --> 40:30.886
[laughing]

40:30.970 --> 40:33.472
Eat up and just pop out a healthy baby.

40:34.056 --> 40:35.224
[woman 3] Thank you.

40:37.393 --> 40:39.895
My lady. Yes, you.

40:39.979 --> 40:41.147
[laughing]

40:41.230 --> 40:43.023
How did you end up here?

40:43.107 --> 40:44.817
You do not seem like one of us.

40:45.943 --> 40:48.571
My husband told me to be here.

40:48.654 --> 40:50.030
[murmuring]

40:50.906 --> 40:52.283
What do you mean by that?

40:52.867 --> 40:55.494
Does your husband know the master
of this household?

40:56.328 --> 40:58.706
My husband is the Crown Prince's guard,

40:58.789 --> 41:00.624
and he went on a trip
with His Royal Highness.

41:00.708 --> 41:04.253
He was worried to leave me alone,
so he told me to come here.

41:04.336 --> 41:05.963
No wonder.

41:06.046 --> 41:08.591
I knew you were not
a pathetic widow like us.

41:08.674 --> 41:10.342
- [women laughing]
- How sweet.

41:10.843 --> 41:12.803
[woman 4] You have a wonderful husband.

41:13.345 --> 41:15.306
Anyway, please eat up.

41:15.806 --> 41:17.308
- Please enjoy.
- [woman 4] Sure.

41:58.807 --> 42:01.810
[court lady]
Your Majesty, it is time for the assembly.

42:03.812 --> 42:04.772
I shall go.

43:04.832 --> 43:07.876
[eunuch] The Queen shall now enter!

43:51.920 --> 43:55.132
[servants] We greet Her Majesty.

44:08.020 --> 44:10.022
[drumbeat thumping]

44:17.905 --> 44:19.156
The Court will hear

44:20.240 --> 44:22.493
Her Majesty's royal edict.

44:26.789 --> 44:29.291
[Hak-ju]
"Heaven gave no blessing to this nation

44:29.917 --> 44:33.504
which led to His Majesty
suddenly falling ill

44:33.587 --> 44:35.214
and losing consciousness.

44:36.173 --> 44:38.050
Meanwhile, his son, the Crown Prince,

44:38.759 --> 44:40.386
committed high treason

44:41.095 --> 44:44.640
by desiring the throne for himself.

44:44.723 --> 44:47.101
Such commotion
has disrupted the royal family,

44:47.184 --> 44:49.144
and the throne is left empty.

44:49.228 --> 44:51.689
Now, a horrendous disease
is spreading through the nation,

44:52.398 --> 44:54.692
bringing nothing but suffering
to the people.

44:54.775 --> 44:56.819
How is this not a tragedy?

44:57.820 --> 45:00.948
I no longer can reject the sincere

45:01.031 --> 45:04.034
and loyal advice
of current and retired officials

45:04.118 --> 45:06.286
regarding the throne staying vacant,

45:06.370 --> 45:10.457
which is why I will brace myself
and take over as Queen Regent."

45:10.541 --> 45:14.169
[servants]
Thank you for your boundless generosity!

45:14.753 --> 45:16.797
On her first day as Queen Regent,

45:17.214 --> 45:20.134
Her Majesty will relay her first orders.

45:20.843 --> 45:24.638
"To eradicate the disease
terrorizing the land of Gyeongsang,

45:24.722 --> 45:26.765
the Five Armies consisting of

45:26.849 --> 45:29.560
the Military Training Command,
the Royal Commandery Division,

45:29.643 --> 45:32.229
and the Southern Fort Command
will be sent to help."

45:34.982 --> 45:36.483
[trumpets blast]

45:36.567 --> 45:38.944
[man] The drum indicates
that they passed the second gate.

45:39.027 --> 45:40.821
They will be here soon.

45:42.906 --> 45:43.991
[gasps]

45:44.074 --> 45:45.659
I see them coming!

46:07.514 --> 46:08.974
THE FIRST GATE OF YEONGNAM

46:17.608 --> 46:18.859
[murmuring]

46:21.195 --> 46:22.446
[gasping]

46:22.529 --> 46:24.156
What is that?

46:27.785 --> 46:29.286
[Hak-ju] "From this moment on,

46:29.828 --> 46:33.123
the western and eastern part of Gyeongsang
will be sealed off."

46:34.625 --> 46:36.627
Seal off the first gate!

46:37.044 --> 46:38.212
What is going on?

46:41.673 --> 46:43.383
What are you doing?

46:43.467 --> 46:45.010
Why are you sealing off-- [grunts]

46:48.430 --> 46:51.058
What are you doing?

46:52.684 --> 46:54.186
[head clerk] Stop!

47:02.152 --> 47:04.112
[groaning]

47:04.196 --> 47:05.113
[gasps]

47:12.079 --> 47:15.999
SANGJU

47:26.301 --> 47:30.514
[Hak-ju] "Mungyeong Saejae, the main road
that leads out of Gyeongsang

47:30.597 --> 47:33.392
as well as all the gates of Jungnyeong,
Chupungnyeong, and Gyeripnyeong

47:33.475 --> 47:35.018
will be sealed off.

47:35.561 --> 47:39.064
Anyone who acts against this order
will be executed on the spot,

47:39.523 --> 47:41.525
thus demonstrating
the seriousness of the law."

47:41.608 --> 47:45.529
[servants]
Thank you for your boundless generosity!

48:04.256 --> 48:06.258
[theme music playing]
